{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/pi/test/clax.test.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:20:21.075171Z","id":"ae4883369be33e9bf366880a986bfdf7093457f41d87f504c4b36031278bbe72","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f2a4d828","summary":"Cause found and fixed in f2a4d828: four tests left extensions outside `loaded`, so their injection loops kept polling a closed fake daemon every INJECT_RETRY_MS, and trackPolls (a DaemonClient.prototype spy) counted those polls in later tests. Evidence: with an 11 s pause at the start of 'the injection loop never starts a stopped daemon', pollsSeen showed [inject#1:failed, inject#2:failed, inject#1:failed, inject#2:failed] before the fix and [] after; the Pi lane then passed (91 of 91).","supersedes":"bd72deaf7c65ec2fd21c99e29f67b614c160beb55699169c5904ded8e3d37ded","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/pi/test/clax.test.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:31:11.642944Z","id":"86334533118ca1d795684a263850e0e11f9ea0ec523a9bb8861a6f08b510b7d1","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Duplicate head left by a merge: this is a parallel branch's re-anchor of the record that ae4883369be33e9bf366880a986bfdf7093457f41d87f504c4b36031278bbe72 closed (Cause found and fixed in f2a4d828: four tests left extensions outside `loaded`, so their injection loops kept polling a closed fake daemon every INJECT_RETRY_MS). That close stands in the merged code; this head carries no new content.","supersedes":"d392dab3dfe53963aa09ebc671d4ecbc64bf8ab9e6c7abe541acbc5897054894","tags":["reason:duplicate","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
